g cash, with roughly 26 months of runway at the current burn."],"generated":true,"note":"Assembled from filing metadata and XBRL figures. Not editorial judgement - and rule 7 asks whether *you* can explain it, so rewrite this in your own words before you rely on it."},"bull":[{"text":"Revenue grew 13.8% year on year (Q1 2026 vs Q1 2025), reaching $61.7m in the quarter.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1846069/000184606926000098/0001846069-26-000098-index.htm","accession":"0001846069-26-000098"},{"text":"Growth has been positive in all 8 year-on-year comparisons, so this is a trend rather than one good quarter.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1846069/000184606926000098/0001846069-26-000098-index.htm","accession":"0001846069-26-000098"},{"text":"Gross margin of 82.1% means most of each additional sale falls through to cover fixed costs.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/cgi-bin/browse-edgar?action=getcompany&CIK=0001846069"},{"text":"Net cash of $56.1m against total assets of $452.5m - no debt overhang forcing decisions.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1846069/000184606926000098/0001846069-26-000098-index.htm","accession":"0001846069-26-000098"},{"text":"Share count is close to flat (0.6% over the year), so growth in the business accrues to existing holders rather than being diluted away.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1846069/000184606926000098/0001846069-26-000098-index.htm","accession":"0001846069-26-000098"}],"bear":[{"text":"The company is loss-making at the operating line (-24.9% margin). Profitability is a forecast, not a fact.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1846069/000184606926000098/0001846069-26-000098-index.htm","accession":"0001846069-26-000098"},{"text":"About 26 months of cash at the current burn ($56.1m against $25.7m a year). A company that must raise is a company that raises on the buyer's terms.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1846069/000184606926000098/0001846069-26-000098-index.htm","accession":"0001846069-26-000098"},{"text":"Officers and directors hold only 1.6% of the shares. There is little alignment between what happens to the share price and what happens to them.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1846069/000184606926000150/0001846069-26-000150-index.htm"},{"text":"Base rate: 57.8% of US common stocks underperformed one-month Treasury bills over their lifetimes (Bessembinder, Journal of Financial Economics, 2018). Nothing above changes that starting point.","source_url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jfineco.2018.06.004"}],"triggers":[{"id":"gross_margin_floor","kind":"metric","label":"Gross margin falls below 74.0% for 2 consecutive quarters","metric":"gross_margin","comparison":"below","threshold":0.74,"consecutive":2,"current":0.821,"current_display":"82.1%","threshold_display":"74.0%","fired":false,"rationale":"Eight points of margin is a real deterioration rather than noise. Two consecutive quarters stops one bad quarter from forcing a sale.","editable":true},{"id":"growth_floor","kind":"metric","label":"Revenue growth falls below -1.0% for 2 consecutive quarters","metric":"revenue_growth_yoy","comparison":"below","threshold":-0.01,"consecutive":2,"current":0.138,"current_display":"13.8%","threshold_display":"-1.0%","fired":false,"rationale":"If growth halves and stays there, the reason you looked at this company has gone.","editable":true},{"id":"runway_floor","kind":"metric","label":"Cash runway falls below 12 months","metric":"runway_months","comparison":"below","threshold":12.0,"consecutive":1,"current":26.189,"current_display":"26 months","threshold_display":"12 months","fired":false,"rationale":"Below twelve months the company raises on whatever terms it can get, and that dilution lands on you.","editable":true},{"id":"dilution_ceiling","kind":"metric","label":"Diluted share count growth rises above 10.0%","metric":"dilution_yoy","comparis